**Auth Token & Device**

What Tuff itself uses to reach the account service. Plugins receive neither the credential nor the device ID; in a plugin these return `null`.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  const token = await accountSDK.getAuthToken()
  const deviceId = await accountSDK.getDeviceId()
---
:::

| Method | Return | Description |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| `getAuthToken()` | `string \| null` | Bearer auth token (null if unavailable) |
| `getDeviceId()` | `string \| null` | Current device id (null if unavailable) |

