**Team Management**

**`getTeams()`**

Gets the organization the account belongs to, at most one; the personal team every account has is not listed. The account service reports no slug or creation time, so `slug` is the `id` and `createdAt` is `0`.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  const teams = await accountSDK.getTeams()
  // [
  //   { id: 'team_xxx', name: 'Dev Team', slug: 'team_xxx', role: 'admin', memberCount: 5, createdAt: 0 }
  // ]
---
:::

**`isInTeam()`**

Check if user is in any team.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  if (await accountSDK.isInTeam()) {
    // Show team features
  }
---
:::

**`isTeamOwner(teamId?)`**

Check if user is team owner.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  if (await accountSDK.isTeamOwner()) {
    // User owns some team
  }

  if (await accountSDK.isTeamOwner('team_xxx')) {
    // User owns specific team
  }
---
:::

**`isTeamAdmin(teamId?)`**

Check if user is team admin (includes owner).

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  if (await accountSDK.isTeamAdmin()) {
    // Show admin features
  }
---
:::

