**Upgrade & Billing**

**`getUpgradeOptions()`**

Get available upgrade options.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  const options = accountSDK.getUpgradeOptions()
  // [
  //   { plan: 'pro', name: 'Pro', priceMonthly: 9.99, features: [...] },
  //   { plan: 'plus', name: 'Plus', priceMonthly: 19.99, recommended: true, ... }
  // ]
---
:::

**`getPlanComparison()`**

Get plan comparison table.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  const comparison = accountSDK.getPlanComparison()
  // [
  //   { feature: 'AI Requests/Week', free: 50, pro: 500, plus: 2000, ... },
  //   { feature: 'Custom Models', free: false, pro: true, ... }
  // ]
---
:::

**`openUpgradePage(plan?)`**

Opens the pricing page in the browser. Given a `plan`, the pricing page outlines that plan's card.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  await accountSDK.openUpgradePage() // Open the pricing page
  await accountSDK.openUpgradePage(SubscriptionPlan.PLUS) // Open the pricing page with Plus outlined
---
:::

**`openBillingPage()`**

Opens the team page, where the plan and activation codes are managed.

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="ts"}
---
code: |
  await accountSDK.openBillingPage()
---
:::

